  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Defense of Mesoamerican Human Rights Defenders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support the creation of region-wide infrastructure that provides human rights groups and defenders in El Salvador, Guatemala and Honduras with support to identify and mitigate security threats, relocate to safety when necessary, and carry on advocacy from a safe location in Mexico in cases where activists&#x2019; work at home has created grave risks to their life and safety.</narrative>
  </description>
